      "text": "Start another one."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 3.5,
      "end": 7.36,
      "timestamp": "0:03",
      "range": "0:03 - 0:07",
      "text": "Okay, so there's one thing that we did in this bathroom that I forgot to mention."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 8.12,
      "end": 10.02,
      "timestamp": "0:08",
      "range": "0:08 - 0:10",
