    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 28.76,
      "end": 33.02,
      "timestamp": "0:28",
      "range": "0:28 - 0:33",
      "text": "have it turn on, like, a half hour before you wake up in the morning and turn off when you're"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 33.06,
      "end": 36.7,
      "timestamp": "0:33",
      "range": "0:33 - 0:36",
      "text": "done getting ready, and then later again at night if you want it to."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 37.76,
      "end": 38.38,
      "timestamp": "0:37",
      "range": "0:37 - 0:38",
      "text": "Pretty awesome."
